{{achievement text | Maggy Now Holds a Pill! }}

== Trivia ==
* This challenge's effect of changing item appearance is similar to the April Fool's 2016 [[daily challenge]].
* {{E|The Bloat}}'s appearance as a replacement for all other bosses is a reference to the exceptional hatred some fans express toward this boss.
** The user who suggested this challenge was banned from [http://www.reddit.com/r/FUCKBLOAT a subreddit] (NSFW) whose theme is hatred towards The Bloat. This same user was also forced to use the "I love The Bloat" flair for a week on the Binding of Isaac [http://www.reddit.com/r/bindingofisaac subreddit].<ref>https://www.reddit.com/r/bindingofisaac/comments/5mbnqs/i_got_banned_from_rfuckbloat_for_coming_up_with/</ref>
* The {{E|Cross Stoney}} is exclusive to this challenge and was added in [[Booster Pack #5]].
** Ironically, Cross Stonies were revealed on April 1.<ref>https://twitter.com/FixItVinh/status/980490518747631616</ref>
** Similarly to The Bloat's inclusion in this challenge, Cross Stonies are a nod to the community's generally negative reaction to {{E|Cross Stone Shooter}}s added in the previous booster pack.

